    "created_at": "2015-02-10T08:33:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-02-10T08:33:40Z",
    "body": "Yeah true, although none of that would be possible anyway from a service worker.\n\nSo... @jakearchibald, you want an equivalent definition of \"allowed to show a popup\" it sounds like, but wouldn't it be better if that was part of the service worker specification?\n",
